#: r2/lib/strings.py:152
msgid "This page shows a history of recent activity on your account. If you notice unusual activity, you should change your password immediately. Location information is guessed from your computer's IP address and may be wildly wrong, especially for visits from mobile devices."
msgstr "Halaman ini menunjukkan sejarah aktiviti terkini pada akaun anda. Jika anda perasan aktiviti luar biasa, anda patut menukar kata laluan anda serta-merta. Maklumat lokasi diteka daripada alamat IP komputer anda dan mungkin sangat tidak tepat, terutamanya untuk lawatan daripada peranti mudah alih."

