#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:37
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Congratulations!** You have been added as a moderator to [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Welcome to the Tippr Moderator Community!\n"
"\n"
"As a moderator, you play a vital role in building and maintaining our community. Here are some important things to know:\n"
"\n"
"### Your Responsibilities\n"
"\n"
"- Enforce vault rules and site-wide policies\n"
"- Foster a welcoming environment for community members\n"
"- Review reports and take appropriate action\n"
"- Collaborate with fellow moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Important Resources\n"
"\n"
"- [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Learn about best practices and expectations\n"
"- [Content Policy](/help/contentpolicy) - Understand site-wide rules\n"
"- [User Agreement](/help/useragreement) - Know the terms of service\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Connect with other moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Volunteer Status\n"
"\n"
"Please note that moderators are independent volunteers, not employees of Tippr. For more details, please review the [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for helping make Tippr a great place!"
msgstr ""
"**Tahniah!** Anda telah ditambah sebagai pengendali [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Selamat datang ke Komuniti Pengendali Tippr!\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai pengendali, anda memainkan peranan penting dalam membina dan mengekalkan komuniti kita. Berikut adalah beberapa perkara penting untuk diketahui:\n"
"\n"
"### Tanggungjawab Anda\n"
"\n"
"- Menguatkuasakan peraturan vault dan dasar seluruh laman\n"
"- Memupuk persekitaran yang mesra untuk ahli komuniti\n"
"- Menyemak laporan dan mengambil tindakan yang sewajarnya\n"
"- Bekerjasama dengan rakan pengendali\n"
"\n"
"### Sumber Penting\n"
"\n"
"- [Garis Panduan Pengendali](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Ketahui amalan terbaik dan jangkaan\n"
"- [Dasar Kandungan](/help/contentpolicy) - Fahami peraturan seluruh laman\n"
"- [Perjanjian Pengguna](/help/useragreement) - Ketahui terma perkhidmatan\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Berhubung dengan pengendali lain\n"
"\n"
"### Status Sukarelawan\n"
"\n"
"Sila ambil perhatian bahawa pengendali ialah sukarelawan bebas, bukan pekerja Tippr. Untuk butiran lanjut, sila semak [Garis Panduan Pengendali](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Terima kasih kerana membantu menjadikan Tippr tempat yang hebat!"

